# prefix-block-opener-quoted-key

## Input

```
'a b.'
  c 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..13
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..13
    QUOTED_KEY@0..6
      SINGLE_QUOTE@0..1 "'"
      STRING@1..5 "a b."
      SINGLE_QUOTE@5..6 "'"
    NEWLINE@6..7 "\n"
    SPACE@7..9 "  "
    ENTRY@9..13
      WORD_KEY@9..10
        WORD@9..10 "c"
      SPACE@10..11 " "
      INTEGER@11..12
        NUMERAL@11..12 "1"
      NEWLINE@12..13 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        PrefixBlock {
            key: QuotedKey {
                open_quote: SINGLE_QUOTE@0..1 "'",
                string: STRING@1..5 "a b.",
                close_quote: SINGLE_QUOTE@5..6 "'",
            },
            items: [
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@9..10 "c",
                    },
                    value: Integer {
                        sign: none,
                        numeral: NUMERAL@11..12 "1",
                    },
                },
            ],
        },
    ],
}
```

